pace%20forms%20retain%20their%20separate%20obligations.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20kind%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20name%20%40returns%20%7Bboolean%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20acceptSourceLibraryReExportName%28kind%2Cname%29%7Breturn%20acceptJavaScriptSourceBindingName%28kind%2Cname%2Cfalse%2C%5B%5D%29%26%26%21acceptJavaScriptReservedIdentifier%28name%29%26%26name%21%3D%3D%27eval%27%26%26name%21%3D%3D%27arguments%27%3B%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20A%20public%20native%20entry%20name%20cannot%20silently%20become%20a%20private%20provider%20name.%0A%20%2A%20Alias%20wrappers%20require%20their%20own%20actual%20callable%2Fconstructor%20transport.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20exported%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20compiled%20%40returns%20%7Bboolean%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20acceptSourceLibraryEntryExportOwner%28exported%2Ccompiled%29%7Breturn%20exported%21%3D%3D%27%27%26%26exported%3D%3D%3Dcompiled%3B%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20keyword%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20kind%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20name%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20callable%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readSourceLibraryClassBindingKind%28keyword%2Ckind%2Cname%2Ccallable%29%7Breturn%20keyword%3D%3D%3D%27class%27%26%26acceptJavaScriptSourceBindingName%28kind%2Cname%2Cfalse%2C%5B%5D%29%26%26%21acceptJavaScriptReservedIdentifier%28name%29%26%26name%21%3D%3D%27eval%27%26%26name%21%3D%3D%27arguments%27%3F%27class%27%3AreadSourceLibraryDeclarationBindingKind%28keyword%2Ckind%2Cname%2Ccallable%29%3B%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20keyword%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20kind%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20name%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20callable%20%40returns%20%7Bboolean%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20acceptSourceLibraryClassExport%28keyword%2Ckind%2Cname%2Ccallable%29%7Breturn%20readSourceLibraryClassBindingKind%28keyword%2Ckind%2Cname%2Ccallable%29%21%3D%3D%27%27%3B%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20term%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20kind